<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Protector 2 - 110,000 tonnes Hampton Roads/Taranto 18-25/10 $5.25 fio 30,000 shinc/30,000 shinc Ilva. Galene - 70,000 tonnes Richards Bay/Algeciras 15-30/10 $5.90 fio scale load/20,000 shinc Yukong.</p>
<p>ORE - Olivia - 150,000 tonnes ore Ponta da Madeira/Constanza 5-10/10 $5.60 fio scale load/30,000 shex Eurasian Express Lines.</p>
<p>TBN 50,000 tonnes bauxite Trombetas/Corpus Christi 20-26/10 $7.00 fio seven days shinc Frapaco.</p>
<p>There were no new fixtures reported from New York on Friday.</p>
</text>
